WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,590
Okay, then be careful and I'll go

2
00:00:11,990 --> 00:00:13,150
Cang Yue, are you serious?

3
00:00:13,510 --> 00:00:14,830
You let me use all my strength

4
00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:27,140
Already grade A

5
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:29,020
Guard is gone

6
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:33,420
After all, that side won three times less than

7
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:35,500
Why don't you fight back?

8
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:37,040
How could I bear it

9
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:46,210
Are you happy with your talk? What are you doing? I'm taking a shower.

10
00:00:46,490 --> 00:00:47,650
Your smell has changed

11
00:00:47,850 --> 00:00:48,890
A bit like high-level Zerg

12
00:00:49,730 --> 00:00:51,210
Maybe I got it from Taiwei Beichen

13
00:00:51,490 --> 00:00:52,530
As long as the spirit is connected

14
00:00:52,650 --> 00:00:54,930
That Zerg frequency is going up, so that’s it

15
00:00:55,330 --> 00:00:56,250
Good job as a sparring partner

16
00:00:56,610 --> 00:01:01,980
Although it's a bit self-inflicted but I thank you for getting the data from my class.

17
00:01:02,180 --> 00:01:03,380
Tonight's final assembly of silver chess

18
00:01:10,180 --> 00:01:11,380
before she gives birth
